onal marketing automation that runs pre-built workflows you configure, an agent decides how to do the job: it learns your brand, drafts the work, and ships it for your approval."},{question:"How is this different from hiring an agency?",answer:"An agency is people you brief and wait on. Magister is an agent that starts working the moment you connect your site: always on, no onboarding cycle, and it works inside your own stack — your CMS, analytics, ad accounts, and Slack. It starts free, and you approve anything before it publishes or spends."},{question:"How much does it cost?",answer:"It starts free — enter your website and get a full AI marketing audit and plan with no credit card. Paid plans add a dedicated, always-on agent that executes the plan. See the pricing page for current tiers."},{question:"How fast can I start?",answer:"Minutes. Enter your website URL and Magister runs a free audit of your SEO, AI-search visibility, content, and site — then builds a marketing plan and can start shipping the first drafts the same day."},{question:"Do I need to bring my own API keys?",answer:"No. Connect uses the model and credentials from your existing AI assistant, while hosted Agent projects use our keys by default. Customers with a hosted Agent project can optionally bring their own Anthropic or OpenAI keys."},{question:"How is this different from just using ChatGPT or Claude?",answer:"Chatbots give you text in a window. Magister is an autonomous agent that works in your actual tools — writing real pages, updating real files, running real audits."},{question:"What can it actually do right now?",answer:"A lot. It writes and ships pages, runs SEO and AI-search audits, builds and sends email sequences, creates and manages ad campaigns, designs on-brand images, and tracks how AI assistants recommend you — then reports on all of it. That's 100+ specialized skills, and you can drive it from the web app, Slack, or your own AI assistant over MCP."},{question:"Is my data safe?",answer:"Hosted Agent runs on an isolated machine for each brand and supports OpenAI, Anthropic, and Google models. Model requests use the selected provider's API and its commercial privacy terms; API data is not used to train public models."},{question:"Can I use it in Slack?",answer:"Yes. You can interact with Magister on the web or directly in your Slack workspace."}];var et=e.i(995599),en=e.i(863149),ea=e.i(167405),es=e.i(49743),eo=e.i(972167),ei=e.i(877810);let el=`Create my Magister Marketing account. Make a POST request to
https://magistermarketing.com/api/signup with a JSON body that has my
email plus a team name, project name, and website URL:

  email:        <the email you want to sign in with>
  team_name:    <your team or company name>
  project_name: <the brand or site you want to work on>
  website_url:  <https://your-website.com>

Then show me the signup_url from the response — I'll open it in my
browser and finish with Google sign-in using that same email.`;var ec=e.i(574883),ed=e.i(465198);let ex=[{icon:M.PenTool,name:"Copywriting & Content",description:"Landing pages, homepage, feature pages, email copy, social posts."},{icon:A.Search,name:"SEO & AI Visibility",description:"Audits, AI-search visibility, competitive gaps, programmatic pages, schema markup."},{icon:z.TrendingUp,name:"Conversion Optimization",description:"Page CRO, signup flows, onboarding, forms, popups, paywalls."},{icon:I.Megaphone,name:"Paid & Distribution",description:"Google Ads, Meta, LinkedIn campaign creation and management."},{icon:P.Zap,name:"Growth Engineering",description:"Free tools, referral programs, A/B tests, analytics setup."},{icon:E.Lightbulb,name:"Strategy & Planning",description:"Pricing, launch plans, marketing psychology, competitive intel."}],em=[{number:"01",title:"Talk to it",description:"Open Magister on the web or in Slack. Describe what you need in plain English."},{number:"02",title:"It plans and executes",description:"Magister taps into 100+ specialized skills to do the actual work — writing copy, auditing your SEO, building email sequences, optimizing pages."},{number:"03",title:"You review and ship",description:"Check what it built, tweak if you want, and push it live. You stay in control."}],eg=["Developer","Marketer","Founder","Designer"],eu=["Beginner","Intermediate","Advanced","Expert"],ef=["Claude Code","Codex","None"],eh=["Web App","Slack","Email","WhatsApp","Discord","Text"],ep=["Landing pages & website copy","SEO audits & improvements","Email sequences & campaigns","Paid ads management","Social media content","Conversion optimization","Competitor analysis","Content strategy","Analytics & reporting","Pricing & packaging","Launch strategy","Referral programs","Programmatic SEO","Free tool building"],ey=[{title:"SaaS founders",description:"You've got 30 minutes between product calls. Magister turns that into a fully written landing page or email sequen